{"id": "DerxcUMk3Y3", "title": "Video by artandartists_ai", "description": "The ATM never sees your PIN. Neither does anyone at your bank. 🔐\n\nYour 4 digits go into an encrypting PIN pad. Press Enter and they're mixed with your card number and locked into 16 scrambled characters: even the ATM's own computer only gets the scramble.\n\nThat block travels to a hardware security module, a vault that wipes its keys if anyone breaks in, and it's only opened inside vaults like that. Your bank usually doesn't even keep your PIN, just a check number made from it.\n\nSo thieves go for your hands: pinhole cameras and fake keypads. And no real bank will ever ask for your PIN.\n\nCover the keypad. Every time. ✋\n\nSend this to someone who types their PIN in full view 😬\n\n#cybersecurity #atm #banking #howtechworks #techexplained", "channel": "artandartists_ai", "uploader_id": "17104311819", "uploader": "Art & Artists - AI", "timestamp": 1792501202, "like_count": 15, "comment_count": 0, "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-18141862219575820a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 65.053, "asr": 48000, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.fblr2-3.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQOnUu_rfKzl6jO6SSDIpcZ257m3Wz7Xspr3CFuLF3Xigc_p4pF97vx4klITAsQKGPtBXaivIGfaBfrP2mxV0YjhTqbJOPQQ5bjDnoU.mp4?_nc_cat=109&_nc_oc=AdrBiDxvd2APtYBlZoZ5DGpH5Xx9vHO16u54_A06y0KGvZEoLxQPDCHUjV7jb2bGyOb6G7Y_jwY-oHbtTnz5v3kf&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.fblr2-3.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=_Bpdo_CgbPoQ7kNvwG4P3c_&%3D&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=NycdFw4yi02H51YgC8-nIw&_nc_ss=70689&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQR2bQOpXglHXgqF6htAKtH6b2BhqnzH68d1cY0E3FADcg&oe=6AF404EE", "manifest_stream_number": 0, "is_dash_periods": true, "protocol": "https", "audio_ext": "m4a", "video_ext": "none", "vbr": 0, "abr": 65.053, "resolution": "audio only", "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64